  "description": "BiharMQTT is a high performance .NET library for MQTT based communication. It provides a MQTT client and a MQTT server (broker) and supports v3.1.0, v3.1.1 and v5.0.0 of the MQTT protocol.",
  "id": "BiharMQTT",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-04-29T05:35:18.737Z",
